    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/18/Rayana_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250303133103\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rayana Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/18/Rayana_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250303133103\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"949\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Rayana Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Rayana_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>极光之辉剑</b>\n</p><p>一位手持剑刃的扭曲美丽战士。正如她威严的外表所示，她以精湛的剑术操纵光刃，使敌人臣服于她。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/34/Rayana_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250303133105\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rayana S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/34/Rayana_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250303133105\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1027\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Rayana S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Rayana_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 233px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c4/QueensBladeLimitBreak_PlayGame-G123_%281%29.gif/revision/latest?cb=20250307044005\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QueensBladeLimitBreak PlayGame-G123 (1)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocoo